  ('sta-112-introductory-probability', 'STA 112: Introductory Probability', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences, Faculty of Engineering, Faculty of Social Sciences, Faculty of Biological Sciences', 'Statistics', '100 Level', 'A random variable $X$ has density $f(x) = 3x^{2}$ for $0 < x < 1$ and 0 otherwise. The mean of $X$ is:', '["1/3","2/3","4/3","3/4"]'::jsonb, 3, '$E(X) = \int_{0}^{1} x\cdot3x^{2}\,dx = \tfrac{3}{4}$.', 'Continuous Random Variables', false, 'second', 3),
